  "body": "## What's Changed\n* docs(cli): update built-in profiles and groups list by @lukehinds in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1840\n* feat(profile)!: remove all legacy aliases and deprecation shims for v1.0.0 prep by @SequeI in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1826\n* docs(cli): link built-in groups to their policy.json source by @SequeI in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1850\n* fix(cli): ignore unhandled keys in the denied-path review selector by @MateSaary in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1852\n* fix(cli): always re-invoke the credential source for ambient captures by @kipz in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1849\n* fix(lib): validate localhost port ranges for zero end and inverted ranges by @Ayush7614 in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1860\n* fix(cli): guard denied-path selector against type-ahead by @MateSaary in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1863\n* fix(cli): keep legacy ~/.claude.json in sync with CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR redirects by @SequeI in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1837\n* ci: run full integration suite on PRs by @SequeI in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1872\n* feat(cli): use CLONE_FILES bootstrap for network-notification sessions by @lukehinds in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1825\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Ayush7614 made their first contribution in https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/pull/1860\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono/compare/v0.76.0...v0.77.0",
